stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Intake

    Intake: Intake & Redaction Agent<br/>OCR - PHI/PII detection - tokenize
    Intake --> Coding

    Coding: Entity & Coding Agent<br/>Extract ICD-10/CPT - write to Neo4j
    Coding --> Retrieval

    Retrieval: GraphRAG Retrieval Agent<br/>Graph traversal + vector search
    Retrieval --> ParallelFork

    state ParallelFork <<fork>>
    ParallelFork --> Policy
    ParallelFork --> Necessity
    ParallelFork --> Fraud

    Policy: Policy & Coverage Agent<br/>Cites policy clauses
    Necessity: Medical Necessity Agent<br/>Cites clinical guidelines + history
    Fraud: Fraud / Anomaly Agent<br/>Pattern + statistical + LLM reasoning

    Policy --> ParallelJoin
    Necessity --> ParallelJoin
    Fraud --> ParallelJoin

    state ParallelJoin <<join>>
    ParallelJoin --> Supervisor

    Supervisor: Supervisor Agent<br/>Synthesize - score confidence - decide route
    Supervisor --> Compliance

    Compliance: Compliance / PHI-Guard Agent<br/>Check leakage - injection - scope
    Compliance --> Decision

    state Decision <<choice>>
    Decision --> AutoConfirm: high confidence,<br/>no risk flags
    Decision --> HumanReview: low confidence OR<br/>agent disagreement OR<br/>risk flag OR high-value claim

    AutoConfirm: Ready for Confirmation<br/>(lightweight human confirm)
    AutoConfirm --> [*]

    HumanReview: LangGraph Interrupt<br/>Durable checkpoint - review queue
    HumanReview --> HumanDecision

    HumanDecision: Human Reviewer<br/>Approve / Edit / Override
    HumanDecision --> FeedbackCapture

    FeedbackCapture: Feedback & Audit Capture<br/>Labeled example -> eval + prompt backlog
    FeedbackCapture --> [*]
